# Blog code

- Import only from `src/blog/` (plus `src/pages` for routes and root `component-types-sb`).
- Use `src/blog/layouts/Layout.astro` and blog CSS (`styles.css`, `cube.css`). Do not import `src/portfolio/`.
- Do not add portfolio paths to `tailwind.blog.config.ts` `content`. Do not use `src/**/*` as a Tailwind glob.
